&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in architecting and deploying large-scale Google Cloud solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in GCP security, networking, and compliance best practices (VPC Service Controls, IAM, Organization Policy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designed end-to-end GCP environments&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;that are highly available, secure, and cost-efficient—leveraging Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE), Cloud Run, Compute Engine, and Cloud SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defined global DR/HA strategies&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;using Cloud Load Balancing, Cloud CDN, and automated failover with multi-region Bigtable/Spanner or persistent disk replication, achieving sub-hour RTOs for critical workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architected end-to-end data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;—built both streaming and batch ETL workflows using Pub/Sub, Dataflow (Apache Beam), and Dataproc to ingest high-throughput events into BigQuery for real-time insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designed scalable data models in BigQuery&lt;/strong&gt;—implemented dimensional schemas with partitioning and clustering to achieve sub-second query times on petabyte-scale datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrated and scheduled workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;leveraging Cloud Composer (Airflow) and Workflows—added automated retries, data-quality validations, and alerting to guarantee pipeline reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automated infrastructure lifecycle via Terraform and Cloud Build pipelines—implementing auto-scaling, patch management, and monitoring workflows that boosted operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mastery of cost control in GCP:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;committed-use discounts, custom machine types, billing export analytics, and budget alerts, plus high-availability patterns for resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnered with data teams to fine-tune architectures on Cloud Storage, BigQuery, Dataflow, and Dataproc—delivering performant, scalable analytics platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership in guiding cross-functional teams and steering complex, multi-phase cloud projects to on-time delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator, adept at crafting business-focused presentations and leading stakeholder workshops on GCP strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solver, experienced in diagnosing and resolving architectural challenges across compute, data, and networking domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at stakeholder management, from technical deep dives with engineering teams to strategic discussions with C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; coaching:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;developing cloud engineering talent through hands-on training, code reviews, and best-practice evangelism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business growth driver&lt;/strong&gt;, recognized for leveraging GCP innovations to unlock new revenue streams and streamline operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

