&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultant – Strategy &amp;amp; Data/AI Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Help our clients in their AI transformations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a curious, analytically minded graduate with a passion for data, AI, and business transformation? Artefact Belgium is looking for a Consultant – Strategy &amp;amp; Data/AI to support our client engagements at the intersection of business and technology. If you are early in your career and excited by the idea of tackling real strategic challenges in a fast-moving AI consulting environment, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in AI applications to help clients achieve tangible business impact. Our Belgium office advises clients on their most pressing strategic challenges : from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured thinker: &lt;/strong&gt;You enjoy breaking down complex problems and approaching them in a logical, methodical way. You are eager to develop your strategic consulting toolkit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuinely curious about data and AI:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t need to be a programmer, but you are fascinated by what data and AI can do for businesses and motivated to build expertise in this space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You express your ideas clearly in writing and in conversation, and you are excited to develop your ability to present to diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative team player:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive working alongside others, ask good questions, take feedback well, and bring energy and reliability to everything you do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ambitious and growth-oriented: &lt;/strong&gt;You are driven by learning, hungry for responsibility, and excited to grow quickly in a demanding and supportive environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to strategy projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Support client engagements on high-stakes questions around AI adoption, data governance, digital transformation, and business model innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct research and analysis: &lt;/strong&gt;Perform market research, competitor analysis, and data-driven analysis to help build clear and actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support end-to-end project delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Assist in structuring problems, preparing client workshops, building deliverables, and contributing to implementation roadmaps under the guidance of senior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop client-ready materials&lt;/strong&gt;: Help create presentations, reports, and frameworks that communicate complex ideas clearly to business and technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow continuously: &lt;/strong&gt;Actively participate in internal training, knowledge-sharing sessions, and team discussions to rapidly build your consulting and data/AI expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to team knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the creation of internal content such as thought pieces, benchmarks, and methodologies that strengthen Artefact Belgium&#39;s expertise and offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s and Master&#39;s degree (preferred) in Business, Engineering, Computer Science, Economics, or a related field; a strong academic track record is valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in both business and technology — you enjoy tackling complex problems and want to develop a structured, strategic mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data and digital technologies (e.g. analytics, AI concepts, digital marketing, cloud platforms); curiosity and willingness to learn matters more than deep expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in English and French or Dutch is required; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be eligible to work in Belgium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with your profile and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on exposure to real client challenges from day one, working alongside experienced strategy and data/AI practitioners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and AI/data capabilities, combined with international exposure across Artefact&#39;s global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, entrepreneurial culture of doers — innovative, fast-moving, and committed to supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value curiosity, motivation, and potential above all else. Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t tick every box — if you&#39;re excited about building a career at the frontier of strategy and AI, we&#39;d love to hear from you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Help our clients in their AI transformations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
