&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage projects, or commercial proposal preparation process, involving the management of multidisciplinary teams, including Consultants, Data Scientists, Data Engineers, Creatives, Media experts and etc ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle clients directly on project assignments (run workshops, client meetings, formal presentations and etc) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring the best of our expertise from the other chapters to your clients on Data Science, Activation (e.g., media buying, CRM, ...) and Creativity ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact-driven with real sales abilities, you will have to embark our clients into a transformation of their marketing, CRM, Supply Chain departments and make sure Artefact is their preferred partner in this endeavor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Among your responsibilities as Consulting Director, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop client portfolio (hunting) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constantly stay on top of the Data, AI, Marketing content ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support a commercial strategy to develop the country client portfolio through personal contacts, events, cold calls, and etc ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the commercial pipeline ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build proposals supporting the client needs ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver the highest standards of quality on your projects ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilot multidisciplinary teams (consultants, data scientists, strategic planners, media traders);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the highest level of quality of output to your clients ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the success of the projects from a client and team perspective ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop our Global Knowledge platform ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build stronghold of knowledge through your clients’ engagements (frameworks, methodologies, technologies, ...) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the spread of the Consulting Department knowledge across the company at local and Global level (in coordination with the Consulting Practice)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in your first 6+ years of career at a tier 1 consulting firm and have 4+ years of experience managing projects and/or clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience in data related topics, including but not limited to data transformation program, cloud infrastructure, AI &amp;amp; machine learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest and appetite in Data, Marketing &amp;amp; Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly adaptable, able to cope with different topics and situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in Dutch (native or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; People of different background and expertise working closely together;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust &amp;amp; Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt; Dealing with data topics with integrity and ethics; Realistic and honest with our capabilities and limitations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation: &lt;/strong&gt;Always working on the most trendy and new topics on data and digital; Always on top of the new ways of using data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Action:&lt;/strong&gt; We would rather do than to tell what to do; Has a “building the plane while flying” agile mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value technical leadership, a drive to innovate, and the ability to bring out the best in others. If you&#39;re ready to own the technical direction of cutting-edge AI projects and make a tangible impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consulting Director Based in Séoul&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you think like a management consultant, thrive in a startup environment, and can’t stop thinking about the intersection of data, technology, and marketing? With over 1000 employees, offices on five continents, and world-class clients like Samsung, L’Oreal, LVMH ... Artefact is a consulting firm that transforms data into value and business impact. We’re opening our first Korean office in Séoul, and we want you to join us to build the business in Korea!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded and headquartered in Paris, Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm, specializing in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organizations. We are proud to say that we help our clients grow their data and digital capabilities, and that we’re also growing in parallel. Our broad range of data-driven solutions in data consulting and digital marketing are designed to meet our clients&#39; specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we&#39;ve acquired with our 300+ client base around the globe. We have 800 employees across 14 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation.&lt;br&gt;Our state-of-the-art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts are all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find out more at Artefact.com&lt;br&gt;What you will be doing&lt;br&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;br&gt;Having recently opened our first office in Séoul, we are looking for a Director to join Artefact consulting practice and grow our footprint within the Korean market. As an experienced consultant, you will play a key role in winning and overseeing consulting engagements, serving as primary contact with clients, assuming the lead role with internal teams of consultants and data scientists, and engaging resources across Artefact’s global offices.&lt;br&gt;Your role will encompass :&lt;br&gt;● Building Artefact’s Korean presence, serving in a leadership capacity for Séoul office, being part of the Partner Group in APAC (offices in Singapore, Hong-Kong, Shanghai and Chengdu), with strong relationships with Artefact global practices (Data Marketing,...)&lt;br&gt;● Creating real impact with clients : winning consulting engagements and overseeing their delivery, transforming data into added value and making sure our clients reap all the benefits.&lt;br&gt;● Bringing your industry and/or functional expertise to help both our own and our client teams develop themselves.&lt;br&gt;● Leading and supporting our clients’ top executives (CMO, CDO, sometimes directly the CEO) with transformation of their business and making sure Artefact is their preferred partner in this endeavor.&lt;br&gt;● Contributing to content development and writing on business-relevant topics (e.g. Artefact published research, articles and business cases).&lt;br&gt;Among your responsibilities as Director, you will :&lt;br&gt;● Deliver the highest standards of quality on your projects&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Pilot multidisciplinary teams (consultants, data scientists, strategic planners, media traders) Ensure the highest level of quality of output to your clients&lt;br&gt;Accountable for the success of the projects from a client and team perspective&lt;br&gt;Lead &amp;amp; develop Séoul’s consulting team&lt;br&gt;Develop consultants&#39; expertise through training and best practice sharing with the other countries (digital ecosystem, consulting hard skills, soft skills, etc.)&lt;br&gt;Communicate the department&#39;s successes and results at the country level (ex: through events and PR)&lt;br&gt;Develop the consulting offer with existing clients, especially with Activation or Data clients Create opportunities for other Departments with your clients (Data Science, Activation, Creativity)&lt;br&gt;Build a commercial strategy to develop the country&#39;s client portfolio (consulting is a very good step in the door) through personal contacts, events, cold calls, ...&lt;br&gt;Monitor the commercial pipeline&lt;br&gt;Build proposals supporting the client needs&lt;br&gt;What we are looking for&lt;br&gt;You have demonstrated success in your first 6+ years of career at a tier 1 consulting firm and have 4+ years of experience managing projects and/or clients.&lt;br&gt;● DOER : you get things done yourself and inspire your teams to do so&lt;br&gt;● ANALYTIC : you LOVE data and think every company should take their decisions with facts&lt;br&gt;● HUNTER : you identify business opportunities and enjoy&lt;br&gt;● MOVER AND SHAKER : you have a hacker mindset and always find the quick wins&lt;br&gt;● MENTOR : your clients and teams naturally seek for advice&lt;br&gt;● AUTONOMOUS : you’re an entrepreneur...&lt;br&gt;Why you should join us ?&lt;br&gt;● Be on a startup team at an established global company: you will be joining a team of driven entrepreneurs. The Artefact Korean business is at the beginning of an exciting growth journey and you’ll be part of the founding team!&lt;br&gt;● Get immersed into the digital and data industry: meet the most innovative partners, deliver cutting-edge projects, and see the industry from backstage. Sooner than you think, you’ll talk about Machine Learning, DevOps and AI like a pro.&lt;br&gt;● Develop your skill set: every day offers new challenges and new opportunities to learn. At Artefact, we take training very seriously, and you’ll be coached and mentored on your technical, consulting, and interpersonal skills on a regular basis.&lt;br&gt;● Make an impact for our clients: come and help industry leaders transform through data! We are devoted to our clients’ success and work hand-in hand with them to upskill their teams and help them reach their goals.&lt;br&gt;● Join a community: join a team of 800 experts and professionals worldwide that will always be willing to help; be part of a startup environment in Séoul, which will make you feel welcome and help you thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Help our clients in their AI transformations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about leveraging data and AI to drive strategic transformation? Artefact Belgium, is looking for a Consulting Manager to join our Brussels team. This is a unique opportunity to lead high-impact consulting projects at the intersection of AI, data, and business strategy while working with top-tier clients across industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in AI applications to help clients achieve tangible business impact. Our Belgium office advises clients on their most pressing strategic challenges : from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a crucial role in driving &lt;strong&gt;data and AI transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt; for our clients. Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining Data &amp;amp; AI Strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising C-level executives (COMEX, marketing, digital, supply-chain, operations, IT, etc.) on data-driven strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading engagements in areas such as Data Strategy, AI Use Cases, Governance &amp;amp; Operating Models, and AI Adoption &amp;amp; Change Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating business challenges into scalable AI and data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing Multi-Disciplinary Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading cross-functional teams of consultants, data analysts, data scientists, and engineers to deliver impactful projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring seamless collaboration between business and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching and developing junior consultants to grow their expertise in data-driven transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving Business Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthening relationships with existing clients to identify new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the expansion of Artefact in Brussels by contributing to client acquisition and market penetration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crafting compelling proposals and responses to RFPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivering High-Impact Projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structuring problem-solving approaches for business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the end-to-end delivery of consulting engagements, from strategy definition to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring the successful adoption of data and AI solutions by client teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contributing to Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Internal Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Becoming an expert in one or more areas (AI Strategy, Data Governance, AI for Finance, Data Marketing, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and delivering trainings for both internal teams and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Representing Artefact at industry events and contributing to thought leadership initiatives (articles, whitepapers, webinars, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting internal initiatives such as recruitment, knowledge management, and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;4+ years of experience in a consulting firm, with a focus on data, AI, or digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, with the ability to link data and AI solutions to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing teams, mentoring junior consultants, and fostering collaboration across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify and develop business opportunities through client interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for data and AI, with a continuous learning mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills in English and French or Dutch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Google Suite / Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with your profile and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on exposure to real client challenges from day one, working alongside experienced strategy and data/AI practitioners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and AI/data capabilities, combined with international exposure across Artefact&#39;s global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, entrepreneurial culture of doers — innovative, fast-moving, and committed to supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value curiosity, motivation, and potential above all else. Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t tick every box — if you&#39;re excited about building a career at the frontier of strategy and AI, we&#39;d love to hear from you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&quot;fusion-responsive-typography-calculated&quot; data-fontsize=&quot;20&quot; data-lineheight=&quot;24px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est une société internationale de conseil en services data et IA, dont le siège est à Paris, qui depuis 10 ans est spécialisée dans la conception et le déploiement de technologies d’intelligence artificielle et de solutions data-driven, dont la mission est d’accélérer l&#39;adoption de l&#39;IA pour un impact positif sur les individus et les organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pionnière dans son domaine, à partir des données et de technologies avancées d’intelligence artificielle, les équipes de consultants métiers et d’ingénieurs travaillent ensemble pour développer des solutions qui créent de l’impact business et améliorent la productivité sur l’ensemble de la chaîne de valeur des entreprises, et ce dans le respect d’un usage éthique et responsable de la data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alliant le meilleur de l’expertise technologique et de l’excellence opérationnelle, Artefact accompagne plus de 1000 sociétés dans le monde pour accélérer leur transformation business, dont plus de 300 entreprises internationales telles qu’Orange, Samsung, L’Oréal ou encore Sanofi. Ses 1700 experts répartis dans 27 bureaux à travers le monde, interviennent dans tous les secteurs clés de l’économie : industrie, retail, luxe, grande consommation, santé, finance, etc…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Stagiaire Data Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, tu seras pleinement intégré(e) à une équipe de consultants. Ton rôle sera d&#39;assister nos clients dans l&#39;élaboration et la mise en œuvre de leur stratégie data, de la phase d&#39;idéation jusqu&#39;à l&#39;implémentation. Tes missions pourront inclure :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cadrage / gestion des projets :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;interview clients et partenaires, mise en place de workshops, préparation des uses cases…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction de roadmaps, d’analyses data-driven avec l’équipe projet&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;et conception d&#39;infrastructures en collaboration avec nos experts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestration du bon déroulement du projet, en appliquant le cas échéant les méthodes agiles (sprints planning et reviews, backlog refinement, démos…)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veille technologique et sectorielle :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;rester à l&#39;affût des dernières tendances en matière de data et d&#39;intelligence artificielle pour proposer des solutions innovantes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Préparer des présentations et des supports de communication pour les comités de direction et les équipes clientes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de recrutement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étape 1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;: Un entretien de fit avec un senior Data Consultant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étape 2&lt;/strong&gt; : Un entretien de type business case avec un premier tour avec un senior ou un manager Data Consultant. Le but de cet entretien est de tester vos méthodes et capacités déductives, votre capacité à résoudre un problème et de confirmer votre intérêt pour Artefact (1 heure)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
