&lt;h3&gt;Join Effixis, an Artefact Company: Shape the Future of Generative AI and Large Language Models (LLMs)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about generative AI and excited by the potential of Large Language Models ? Effixis, an Artefact company, is seeking an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;LLM Engineer Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join our innovative team. If you&#39;ve already explored the world of LLMs or have a strong interest in generative AI, this is your chance to contribute to cutting-edge projects and gain hands-on experience in a dynamic, forward-thinking environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A student or recent graduate with &lt;strong&gt;experience experimenting with LLMs&lt;/strong&gt; or a strong interest in &lt;strong&gt;generative AI&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;NLP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiastic about applying theoretical knowledge to real-world challenges in AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to thrive in both collaborative and independent projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to learn, adapt, and grow in a fast-paced, innovative setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effixis is part of the Artefact Group, a leading Data &amp;amp; AI consulting firm operating at the forefront of NLP and LLM-driven innovation. With offices worldwide, we help clients across industries, including public health, manufacturing, and media, harness the power of generative AI. At Artefact, we value&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;innovation&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;continuous learning&lt;/strong&gt;, and we are committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our data science team to &lt;strong&gt;experiment with LLMs&lt;/strong&gt; and explore innovative generative AI use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and optimization of NLP and LLM-powered tools and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in deploying and maintaining AI systems, including models, APIs, and related infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in brainstorming sessions and technical decision-making to shape cutting-edge solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience with LLMs or a strong interest in generative AI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing or holding a degree in computer science, mathematics, physics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python and a willingness to learn NLP and AI frameworks (e.g., Hugging Face, OpenAI, Cohere).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills in &lt;strong&gt;English or French&lt;/strong&gt; (other languages are a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive internship &lt;strong&gt;compensation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to work with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;state-of-the-art LLM technology&lt;/strong&gt; and contribute to groundbreaking projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;dynamic, supportive work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that values creativity and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated resources for training and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Brussels&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t worry if you don’t meet all the criteria! We value motivation and potential above all else. We’d love to hear from you and learn more about your passion for generative AI.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Artefact is a leading global consulting company dedicated to accelerating the adoption of data and AI to positively impact people and organizations. We specialize in data transformation and data marketing to drive tangible business results across the entire enterprise value chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact offers the most comprehensive set of data-driven solutions per industry, built on deep data science and cutting-edge AI technologies, delivering AI projects at scale in all industry sectors. From strategy to operations, we offer an end-to-end approach and solutions: data strategy, data quality and governance, data platforms, AI Factory, data-driven customer experience and marketing ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 2000+ employees operate in 27 countries (Europe, Asia, Americas, Middle East, Africa) and we partner with 1000 clients, including some of the world&#39;s top 300 brands such as Samsung, L&#39;Oréal and Sanofi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead and conduct ambitious projects aimed at transforming clients through data. Your day-to-day responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading Transformational Projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Spearheading ambitious projects that utilize data to transform our clients’ operations and strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developing Data Science Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Creating innovative data science products and solutions for both clients and our internal data science team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building Client Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborating closely with your Consulting counterpart to understand client needs and strengthen relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upskilling the Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Contributing to the development of our data science team by sharing knowledge, mentoring junior Data Scientists, and promoting our work within other data departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensuring Quality Deliverables:&lt;/strong&gt; Caring for team morale and ensuring that all missions are delivered to a high standard, providing feedback and support to less experienced team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimising Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Writing highly optimized code to advance Artefact’s internal toolbox and knowledge base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn With Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-World Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver impactful projects by developing end-to-end machine learning pipelines to solve real-world problems across various industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Work in feature teams alongside other data scientists, ML engineers, data engineers, software engineers, and product owners to build complex solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Enhance your software engineering skills by applying ML Ops best practices while working with machine learning teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Become an expert in one of our data science practices: Time Series Forecasting, MLOps, NLP, Computer Vision, Optimization, or Customer Intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Algorithm Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Discover state-of-the-art algorithms and test them on real-world data during client projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking someone who has:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational Background:&lt;/strong&gt; A completed Master’s degree in a relevant field (e.g., computer science, machine learning, mathematics, or related subjects).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; 1-3 years of experience in data science, analytics, or consulting, preferably within a marketing or digital context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong knowledge of data processing, algorithms, and data architecture, along with proficiency in tools like Python, SQL, and R.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A passion for working with data to derive actionable insights and solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to discuss both technical and non-technical topics with clients and team members.&lt;/li&gt;
