&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR &amp;amp; Admin Intern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Lead the Future of Generative AI and Large Language Models&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a proactive talent enthusiast with a passion for people and technology? Artefact Belgium is looking for an HR &amp;amp; Admin Intern to help us attract, develop, and support the brightest minds in the Data &amp;amp; AI industry. If you are a student or recent graduate who thrives in a fast-paced consulting environment and wants to shape the culture of a leading AI firm, we invite you to join our team in Brussels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aspiring HR Professional: Currently pursuing or recently completed a degree in Human Resources, Psychology, Business, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People-Centric &amp;amp; Tech-Curious: You don’t need to code, but you are excited by the world of AI and understand that great technology is built by great people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized &amp;amp; Agile: Able to manage multiple administrative and creative tasks with a high degree of autonomy and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Communicator: Excellent interpersonal skills with the ability to engage with diverse profiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to Grow: A &quot;can-do&quot; attitude, ready to learn the ropes of HR operations, recruitment, and employer branding in a global firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a leading Data &amp;amp; AI consulting firm at the forefront of AI innovation. With a global presence, we collaborate with top-tier clients across industries, including healthcare, manufacturing, and media, to harness the transformative power of generative AI. Our team in Belgium is specialized in LLM and GenAI projects, working on the most advanced applications of these technologies. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on HR Policies: Work directly with the HR Manager to research, draft, and implement internal policies (e.g., remote work frameworks, wellbeing programs, car/mobility policies, and CSR initiatives).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Talent Acquisition: Assist in the end-to-end recruitment process, from sourcing specialized AI talent to managing the candidate pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Employer Branding: Help execute local initiatives (social media, campus events) to position Artefact as the employer of choice for tech talent in Belgium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People Operations &amp;amp; Compliance: Assist with the administrative lifecycle—onboarding, contract prep, and ensuring our processes align with Belgian labor standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster Culture: Help organize internal events and workshops that reinforce our &quot;One Artefact&quot; spirit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current Student Status: You must be enrolled in a University or High School program (Hogeschool/Haute École). This internship is unpaid and governed by an internship agreement (stageovereenkomst/convention de stage) provided by your school.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language Skills: Strong written and verbal communication skills in English. Knowledge of Dutch and/or French is highly valued for navigating Belgian social legislation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech Savvy: Comfortable using Microsoft Office (Excel, PowerPoint) and curious about learning HRIS and recruitment tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliability: A high level of confidentiality and professional integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Responsibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You won&#39;t just be making coffee; you will be a full member of the HR team with ownership of specific projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; A front-row seat to the latest trends in Generative AI and Data Science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to a global network of experts across the Artefact group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Coaching:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work closely with our HR Manager, receiving practical guidance and feedback on your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; A collaborative and inclusive workplace in the heart of Brussels, with exposure to the latest trends in the AI industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; is the next generation end-to-end data service company, with a focus on consulting and marketing, that helps organisations transform data into value and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our broad range of data-driven solutions in data consulting and digital marketing are designed to meet our clients’ specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible resultsWe have 2000+ employees across 36 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: State of the art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist partner to prepare pitching material&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support to develop appealing charts, graphs, and other documentation to illustrate research results under guidance by the team lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Group/Partner on any admin tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertake ad hoc assignments from time to time and other duties as requested by management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduates and bachelor’s degree holder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and knowledge in Data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with Microsoft Office applications especially Excel and Powerpoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can work 3 days per week for 2 months at least(mini 2 days onsite)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize tasks and work under tight deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Belief&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe data is changing the world, and it’s just the beginning. We want this to be done in the right way, with transparency and ethics. This is the only way to create sustainable impact for business and society.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on a mission to build the next generation of data leaders who:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully capture the power of data &amp;amp; digital to deliver business value&amp;nbsp;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring understanding, trust &amp;amp; transparency of data into our society.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration&amp;nbsp;: People of different background and expertise working closely together;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trust &amp;amp; Transparency: Dealing with data topics with integrity and ethics; Realistic and honest with our capabilities and limitations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovation: Always working on the most trendy and new topics on data and digital; Always on top of the new ways of using data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Action: We would rather do than to tell what to do; Has a “building the plane while flying” agile mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Unique Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We bring great value to business and create a better society with the understanding, transparency and ethical use of data&amp;nbsp;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We build the next generation of data leaders&amp;nbsp;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We disrupt the market&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Native - Born with data and defining data&amp;nbsp;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ART + SCIENCE - Mixture of talents in ART (Creative, Planning, Media, Consumer Engagement) and SCIENCE (Data Consulting, Data Science, Data Engineer)&amp;nbsp;;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One P&amp;amp;L - Integrated &amp;amp; collaborative, with all chapters working toward the same goal&amp;nbsp;;&lt;/li&gt;
