&lt;li&gt;Research and develop new technical approaches to address challenges efficiently in the marketing and media domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create data visualization dashboards tailored to marketing decision-making while aligning with business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to the expertise and competencies of the Data &amp;amp; Analytics team and work closely with other divisions, including Media &amp;amp; Activation, Creation, Consulting, Data Science, and Data Engineering, to provide comprehensive services to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
