&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong business-orientation with great verbal and written communication skills; ability to represent Artefact in a client-facing capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage with diverse team members; strong intercultural communication skills are a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced familiarity with Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Google Suite a plus&lt;/li&gt;
