&lt;h2&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Junior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;London office&lt;/strong&gt;, your role will encompass:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
