&lt;h3&gt;Tell us about you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in joining our team, but did not find what you are looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Send us your Resume, your contact, and a few words, we would check it for you!&lt;br&gt;Please indicate your preference in terms of Office locations and Practices, and our team would contact you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missed out an opportunity at Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Indicate the name of the job that you wanted to apply, and we would contact you at the soonest open opportunity!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why should you join us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Artefact is the place to be: come and build the future of data and marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovation: We have a passion for creating impacting projects, and believe innovation can come from anyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Action: We make things rather than telling people how to make them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: We believe in bringing talented people together, in winning together, and in learning from each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a new generation of a data service provider, specialising in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organisations. We are proud to say we’re enjoying skyrocketing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our broad range of data-driven solutions in data consulting and digital marketing are designed to meet our clients’ specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we’ve acquired with our 1000+ client base around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have 1000 employees across 20 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: State of the art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing: Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role will be encompass:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead our Consulting Department in country (P&amp;amp;L responsibility). The leadership structure for this Department is a partnership, similar to those found in Management Consulting firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring the best of our expertise from the other Departments to your clients on Data Science, Activation (e.g., media buying, CRM, …) and Creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact-driven with real sales abilities, you will have to embark our clients top executives (CMOs, CDO, sometime directly the CEOs) into a transformation of their marketing department and make sure Artefact/NetBooster is their preferred partner in this endeavour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Among your responsibilities as Partner, you will :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the country Consulting Department&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilot the consulting department P&amp;amp;L (forecast, revenue and margin, cash, reporting to country and global management) in link with the Finance department in country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the HR needed and the process to attract and retain the best talents from the consulting and the digital space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the best allocation of consultants resources to clients and projects (staffing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the consultants expertises through trainings and best practice sharing with the other countries (digital ecosystem, consulting hard skills, soft skills, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate the Department successes and results at country level (ex : through events and PR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the highest standards of quality on your projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilot multidisciplinary teams (consultants, data scientists, strategic planners, media traders)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the highest level of quality of output to your clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the success of the projects from a client and team perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop client portfolio (hunting)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a commercial strategy to develop the country client portfolio (consulting is a very good step in the door) through personal contacts, events, cold calls, …&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the commercial pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build proposals supporting the client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen our relationships with current clients (farming)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the consulting offer with existing clients, especially with Activation or Data clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create opportunities for other Departments with your clients (Data Science, Activation, Creativity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop our Global Knowledge platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build stronghold of knowledge through your clients engagements (frameworks, methodologies, technologies, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the spread of the Consulting Department knowledge across the company at local and&amp;nbsp;Global level (in coordination with the Consulting Practice)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have demonstrated success in your first 10+ years of career at a tier 1 consulting firm and have 6+ years of experience managing projects and/or clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DOER​ :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;you get things done yourself and inspire your teams to do so&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ANALYTIC​ :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you LOVE data and think every company should take their decisions with facts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUNTER​ :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;you identify business opportunities and enjoy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MOVER AND SHAKER​ :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you have a hacker mindset and always find the quick wins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MENTOR​ :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;your clients and teams naturally seek for advice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AUTONOMOUS​ :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;you’re an entrepreneur…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artefact is the place to be:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;come and build the future of marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Progress:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;every day offers new challenges and new opportunities to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;join the best team you could ever imagine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurship:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you will be joining a team of driven entrepreneurs. We won’t give up until we make a huge dent in this industry!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#FR&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming&amp;nbsp;organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting&amp;nbsp;with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible&lt;br&gt;business impact.&lt;br&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work&amp;nbsp;with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Zurich office is&amp;nbsp;at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic&amp;nbsp;challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and&amp;nbsp;new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Manager Consultant in our Zurich office, you will be at the intersection of strategy consulting and data/AI innovation. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions: How can AI reshape our business model? How should we&amp;nbsp;govern and organize for data? Which strategic programs deliver the most&amp;nbsp;impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Break down complex challenges into clear,&amp;nbsp;actionable recommendations, using frameworks and methodologies rooted in&amp;nbsp;classic strategy consulting, enriched by Artefact’s data and AI expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Support engagements end-to-end, from hypothesis framing&amp;nbsp;and market/competitor analysis to client workshops, governance design, and&amp;nbsp;implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with C-level stakeholders and business&amp;nbsp;unit leaders. You’ll build trusted relationships, communicate recommendations&amp;nbsp;with clarity, and ensure strategic alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the growth of Artefact’s Zurich&amp;nbsp;office by shaping new offerings, creating intellectual capital (frameworks, thought&amp;nbsp;pieces, benchmarks), and participating in business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead, mentor, and foster collaboration within hybrid project teams, ensuring high-quality delivery and team growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious, analytically minded talent who is passionate about&amp;nbsp;leveraging data and AI to solve business problems. The ideal candidate meets several&amp;nbsp;of the following qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s and Master’s degree (preferred) in Business,&amp;nbsp;Engineering, Computer Science, Economics or a related field. An excellent&amp;nbsp;academic track record is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Approximately 5–8 years of experience in strategy consulting, with a&amp;nbsp;proven track record of delivering data, analytics, or AI-driven transformation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong dual affinity for business and technology. You possess a deep understanding of modern data and AI concepts (e.g., Generative AI, LLMs, predictive machine learning, cloud architectures) and their practical business applications. While you do not need to be a programmer, you must be capable of scoping AI use cases and confidently discussing tech constraints and opportunities with c-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge of data and digital technologies&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g. analytics, AI, machine&amp;nbsp;learning concepts, digital marketing, cloud platforms) is expected – you don’t&amp;nbsp;need to be a programmer, but you should be tech-savvy and eager to deepen&amp;nbsp;your understanding of the data/AI domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative and analytical skills,&amp;nbsp;with an ability to draw insights from data. You have an analytical mindset and are&amp;nbsp;comfortable handling data-driven analysis to support decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills, both&amp;nbsp;written and verbal. You can present complex ideas clearly and can adapt your&amp;nbsp;message to both technical and non-technical audiences. Experience creating&amp;nbsp;impactful presentations or reports is a must. You also enjoy working&amp;nbsp;collaboratively in teams and liaising with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in German and English (both written and spoken) is&amp;nbsp;mandatory; French is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is not a traditional strategy consultancy nor&amp;nbsp;a pure tech player — we sit uniquely at the crossroads, giving you the chance to&amp;nbsp;build boardroom-level strategy expertise while being at the forefront of AI and&amp;nbsp;digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a growing Swiss team, you will have visibility&amp;nbsp;and impact from day one. You will help shape Artefact’s footprint in the region&amp;nbsp;and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies&amp;nbsp;and AI/data capabilities, combined with international exposure.• Culture of Doers: Innovation, Action, Collaboration. We are entrepreneurial,&amp;nbsp;fast-moving, and committed to delivering impact — while supporting each other’s&amp;nbsp;growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t worry if you don’t meet all the criteria! We value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else. We’d love to hear from you and learn more about your passion for driving the AI revolution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;107&quot; data-end=&quot;126&quot;&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Romandie office (Geneva/Lausanne) is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;821&quot;&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Senior AI &amp;amp; Data Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the architect of the &quot;AI Factory.&quot; Your role is less about training models from scratch and more about building the industrial-grade pipelines, infrastructure, and security frameworks required to run AI in a highly regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Production-Grade AI Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement robust MLOps and LLMOps pipelines specifically for banking environments, focusing on data residency, air-gapping possibilities, and high availability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data Engineering for AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Build scalable ETL/ELT pipelines to feed RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) systems, ensuring data lineage, quality, and strict access control (RBAC).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the CI/CD lifecycle for AI assets. Automate the deployment of model APIs, vector databases, and monitoring stacks using Infrastructure as Code (IaC).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hybrid Cloud &amp;amp; On-Prem:&lt;/strong&gt; Navigate complex hybrid-cloud architectures (Azure/AWS/GCP vs. Private Cloud) common in Swiss banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a bridge between IT Infrastructure, Risk/Compliance, and Business units to translate AI potential into stable, governed reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2602&quot; data-end=&quot;2622&quot;&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2623&quot; data-end=&quot;2715&quot;&gt;Engineer first, consultant second — with a builder’s mindset and a track record of shipping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 4+ years in Data Engineering, DevOps, or Software Engineering, with at least 2 years focused on deploying Machine Learning or AI systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
