&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&quot;Translator.&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; You should be someone who enjoys the nuance of business operations just as much as a clean SQL query.&lt;/p&gt;
