&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Business Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a solid grasp of how global corporations operate (supply chain, distribution, or commercial data). Experience with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;141&quot;&gt;Anaplan&lt;/strong&gt; logic is a major plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years in data analytics, business intelligence, or consulting. You have a track record of owning projects from requirements gathering to final delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;English and French&lt;/strong&gt; are mandatory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Why Join Artefact Switzerland?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Senior Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; You will have high visibility within the firm and with the client. You aren&#39;t a cog in a machine; you are an architect of solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Modern Analytics Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; We focus on the &quot;best of breed&quot; tools (GCP, dbt, Looker), allowing you to spend more time on insights and less time on technical &quot;plumbing.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Entrepreneurial Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; We are a fast-growing team in Switzerland. You will help shape the culture and the way we deliver projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Focus on Value:&lt;/strong&gt; We prioritize tangible business impact over technical vanity projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is located in the Geneva area.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming&amp;nbsp;organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting&amp;nbsp;with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible&lt;br&gt;business impact.&lt;br&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work&amp;nbsp;with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Zurich office is&amp;nbsp;at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic&amp;nbsp;challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and&amp;nbsp;new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Consultant in our Zurich office, you will be at the intersection of strategy consulting and data/AI innovation. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions: How can AI reshape our business model? How should we&amp;nbsp;govern and organize for data? Which strategic programs deliver the most&amp;nbsp;impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Break down complex challenges into clear,&amp;nbsp;actionable recommendations, using frameworks and methodologies rooted in&amp;nbsp;classic strategy consulting, enriched by Artefact’s data and AI expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Support engagements end-to-end, from hypothesis framing&amp;nbsp;and market/competitor analysis to client workshops, governance design, and&amp;nbsp;implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with C-level stakeholders and business&amp;nbsp;unit leaders. You’ll build trusted relationships, communicate recommendations&amp;nbsp;with clarity, and ensure strategic alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the growth of Artefact’s Zurich&amp;nbsp;office by shaping new offerings, creating intellectual capital (frameworks, thought&amp;nbsp;pieces, benchmarks), and participating in business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious, analytically minded talent who is passionate about&amp;nbsp;leveraging data and AI to solve business problems. The ideal candidate meets several&amp;nbsp;of the following qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s and Master’s degree (preferred) in Business,&amp;nbsp;Engineering, Computer Science, Economics or a related field. An excellent&amp;nbsp;academic track record is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Approximately 2–4 years of experience in strategy consulting, data/digital consulting, or business analyst roles, with hands-on exposure to data, analytics, or AI-driven projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; A dual affinity for business and technology. You&amp;nbsp;enjoy solving complex problems and can approach challenges in a structured,&amp;nbsp;strategic way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge of data and digital technologies&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g. analytics, AI, machine&amp;nbsp;learning concepts, digital marketing, cloud platforms) is expected – you don’t&amp;nbsp;need to be a programmer, but you should be tech-savvy and eager to deepen&amp;nbsp;your understanding of the data/AI domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative and analytical skills,&amp;nbsp;with an ability to draw insights from data. You have an analytical mindset and are&amp;nbsp;comfortable handling data-driven analysis to support decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills, both&amp;nbsp;written and verbal. You can present complex ideas clearly and can adapt your&amp;nbsp;message to both technical and non-technical audiences. Experience creating&amp;nbsp;impactful presentations or reports is a must. You also enjoy working&amp;nbsp;collaboratively in teams and liaising with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in German and English (both written and spoken) is&amp;nbsp;mandatory; French is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is not a traditional strategy consultancy nor&amp;nbsp;a pure tech player — we sit uniquely at the crossroads, giving you the chance to&amp;nbsp;build boardroom-level strategy expertise while being at the forefront of AI and&amp;nbsp;digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a growing Swiss team, you will have visibility&amp;nbsp;and impact from day one. You will help shape Artefact’s footprint in the region&amp;nbsp;and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies&amp;nbsp;and AI/data capabilities, combined with international exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, Action, Collaboration. We are entrepreneurial, fast-moving, and committed to delivering impact — while supporting each other’s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t worry if you don’t meet all the criteria! We value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else. We’d love to hear from you and learn more about your passion for driving the AI revolution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;pt-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Help our clients in their AI transformations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you an analytically minded consultant with a passion for data, AI, and business transformation? Artefact Belgium is looking for a Senior Consultant – Strategy &amp;amp; Data/AI to help our clients navigate their most complex strategic challenges at the intersection of business and technology. If you have 2-4 years of consulting or related experience, combined with a dual affinity for strategy and data, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in AI applications to help clients achieve tangible business impact. Our Belgium office advises clients on their most pressing strategic challenges : from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You break down complex business problems into clear, structured recommendations. You are comfortable operating at the C-level and translating ambiguity into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-savvy consultant:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t need to be a programmer, but you are genuinely curious about data and AI technologies and eager to deepen your expertise in this space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Engagement Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a proven capacity to lead projects client side. You excel at managing expectations, defining project scope, and providing strategic guidance to technical teams to ensure delivery aligns with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client-facing communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders, present ideas with clarity, and adapt your message to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative doer:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in multidisciplinary teams, move fast, and take ownership of your work from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ambitious and driven:&lt;/strong&gt; You are motivated by impact, eager to grow, and excited by the opportunity to help shape a fast-growing office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategy development: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions — How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organize for data? Which strategic programs deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve complex problems:&lt;/strong&gt; Break down ambiguous challenges into clear, actionable recommendations using structured frameworks, enriched by Artefact&#39;s data and AI expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver end-to-end engagements:&lt;/strong&gt; Support projects from hypothesis framing and market/competitor analysis to client workshops, governance design, and implementation roadmaps with the technical team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage senior stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with C-level executives and business unit leaders, building trusted relationships and ensuring strategic alignment throughout engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build knowledge and offerings: &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Belgium office by shaping new service offerings, creating intellectual capital (frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks), and supporting business development efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to thought leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Publish insights, participate in industry events, and help position Artefact Belgium as a leading voice on AI and data transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s and Master&#39;s degree (preferred) in Business, Engineering, Computer Science, Economics, or a related field; an excellent academic track record is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 2-4 years of experience in strategy consulting, data/digital consulting, or a related field (including internships or business analyst roles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dual affinity for business and technology — you enjoy solving complex problems and can approach challenges in a structured, strategic way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data and digital technologies (e.g. analytics, AI, machine learning concepts, digital marketing, cloud platforms); you don&#39;t need to be a programmer, but you should be tech-savvy and eager to grow in the data/AI domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with experience creating impactful presentations and reports for senior audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in English and French or Dutch is required; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be eligible to work in Belgium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with your expertise and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A unique positioning at the crossroads of boardroom-level strategy and cutting-edge AI — not a traditional consultancy, not a pure tech player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visibility and impact from day one as part of a growing Belgian team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional growth through regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and AI/data capabilities, combined with international exposure across Artefact&#39;s global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, entrepreneurial culture of doers — innovative, fast-moving, and committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value motivation and potential above all else. Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet every criterion — if you&#39;re passionate about leveraging data and AI to drive real business impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Consulting Manager – Data &amp;amp; AI Consulting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact UK – London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid working pattern&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Artefact is a new generation of a data service provider, specialising in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organisations. We are proud to say we’re enjoying skyrocketing growth.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Our broad range of data-driven solutions in data consulting and digital marketing are designed to meet our clients’ specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we’ve acquired with our 1000+ client base around the globe.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We have over 2400 employees across 36 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: State of the art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;As a Senior Consulting Manager, you will play a key leadership role in delivering high-impact data and AI transformation programmes for our clients. You will lead multidisciplinary teams, build trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders, and contribute to the commercial growth of the consulting practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Consulting Director, you will be responsible for managing complex engagements, developing new business opportunities, and supporting the development of our consulting capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Leadership &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and deliver large-scale consulting engagements focused on data, AI, and digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to senior client stakeholders, including Director and C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects are delivered to the highest standards of quality, impact, and client satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data and analytics solutions into clear business value for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project governance, timelines, budgets, and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multidisciplinary teams of consultants, data scientists, data engineers, and digital specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor Consultants, Senior Consultants, and Managers, supporting their professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative, high-performance team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support recruitment and talent development within the consulting practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Growth &amp;amp; Business Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and develop new business opportunities with existing and prospective clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to account growth strategies and client portfolio development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of client proposals, commercial pitches, and RFP responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the commercial pipeline management and revenue growth of the consulting practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of Artefact’s consulting methodologies, frameworks, and offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and best practices across teams at both local and global levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support thought leadership initiatives and contribute to industry insights, whitepapers, and client events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future growth of the consulting practice in Data &amp;amp; AI transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of your&amp;nbsp; career at a tier 1 consulting firm and 4+years of experience managing projects and/or clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading consulting engagements and managing client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data, AI, analytics, and digital transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading multidisciplinary teams and delivering complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with experience supporting sales, proposals, and account growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, including experience presenting to senior executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with a passion for data-driven decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial and proactive attitude with the ability to identify opportunities and drive impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4250&quot; data-end=&quot;4350&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4250&quot; data-end=&quot;4260&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;4260&quot; data-end=&quot;4263&quot;&gt;Work with leading organisations to drive meaningful transformation through data and AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4352&quot; data-end=&quot;4480&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4352&quot; data-end=&quot;4362&quot;&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;4362&quot; data-end=&quot;4365&quot;&gt;Join one of the fastest-growing global data consulting companies with significant career development opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4482&quot; data-end=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4482&quot; data-end=&quot;4493&quot;&gt;Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;4493&quot; data-end=&quot;4496&quot;&gt;Collaborate with a team of talented experts in data science, engineering, consulting, and digital marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4606&quot; data-end=&quot;4730&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4606&quot; data-end=&quot;4626&quot;&gt;Entrepreneurship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;4626&quot; data-end=&quot;4629&quot;&gt;Be part of an ambitious and innovative company where ideas are valued and initiatives are encouraged.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a new generation of data service providers, specialising in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing. It is dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organisations. We are proud to say we’re enjoying skyrocketing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The backbone of our consulting missions, today our Data consulting team has more than 400 consultants covering all Artefact&#39;s offers (and more): data marketing, data governance, strategy consulting, product owner…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage projects as well as lead our business growth, the data consulting teams welcome all business and technical background joiners, who would thrive as an expert in a specific field, or truly versatile players.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this fast-paced, fast-growing industry, the most important qualities in our eyes are intellectual curiosity, autonomy and dynamism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You wield both “business” and “data” knowledge, with experience ideally in a digital marketing consulting firm; You already have a first understanding of digital technologies, and care to develop more in the exciting world of data and digital business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must have previous Management Consultancy, ideally within Strategy Consulting or Data Consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduated from Business school or Engineering, in our eyes&#39; the most important qualities are intellectual curiosity, autonomy, and dynamism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are looking for profiles with the double hat “business” and “data”, with at least 1-2 years of experience, and in the use of BI tools or data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will already understand digital technologies (Tracking, Machine Learning, RTB, Big Data, Platform as a Service,…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is the place to be: come and build the future of data and marketing!&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We have a passion for creating impacting projects and believe innovation can come from anyone.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Action:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We make things rather than telling people how to make them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We believe in bringing talented people together, winning together, and in learning from each other.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est une nouvelle génération de cabinet de conseil spécialisée en Data dont plus de 1500 employés répartis sur 25 pays ont pour mission d’accompagner la transformation chez nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous offrons une large gamme de solutions data-driven, que nous adaptions aux besoins spécifiques de nos clients, que ce soit des projets IA pour l&#39;automatisation des process internes à chaque étape de leur chaîne de valeur, la création d&#39;expériences consommateurs innovantes et personnalisées, le conseil en stratégie data et marketing digital jusqu&#39;à la gestion du mix-média et plus encore !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La performance de nos services data repose sur une réelle expertise technologique en Intelligence Artificielle et des compétences métiers acquises auprès de plus de 1000 clients dans le monde, tels que AccorHotels, Orange, Carrefour, Engie, Emirates, Deutsche Telekom, Monoprix…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La force d&#39;Artefact repose sur un mix unique d&#39;atouts: une connaissance des technologies de pointe en data, des méthodes agiles permettant de délivrer très rapidement les projets et des équipes composées des meilleurs experts dans leurs domaines (business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, ingénieurs data…).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités principales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Définition de stratégie autour de la Data et de l’IA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner la transformation data de nos clients C-Levels dans leurs différents domaines d&#39;activité : COMEX, marketing, digital, supply-chain, opérations, customer support, IT, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faire preuve d’agilité intellectuelle et de rigueur pour piloter des projets à haute valeur stratégique pour nos clients en vous appuyant sur l&#39;expertise et les offres d&#39;Artefact:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stratégie Data et IA&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business case et valorisation (topline, bottomline, CSR, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gouvernance de la donnée &amp;amp; Operating Model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cadrage et déploiement de Cas d’usages data et IA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture, gestion du changement &amp;amp; adoption autour de la data et IA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le/La Senior Data Consultant(e)&amp;nbsp; pilote, avec une large autonomie, des projets complets de bout en bout. Localisé dans des équipes chez le client ou dans nos bureaux, il/elle est supervisé/e par un n+1 (manager, directeur, partner) et il est amené à encadrer les consultants plus juniors.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les activités à sa charge comprennent notamment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le pilotage d’un ou plusieurs streams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir le delivery de la mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier les points de blocage et proposer des solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la gestion de projet (Prise de note, compte-rendu, documentation, planning…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fournir des feedbacks constructifs aux membres plus juniors de l&#39;équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La production des livrables de mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produire de manière autonome des présentations (benchmarks, études de cas, workshops decks, sections steerco).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des storylines (messages clés, contenu...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et livrer des slides percutantes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Animer les interviews et workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La conduite de la relation client&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire une relation de confiance avec les clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Démontrer de l&#39;assurance dans les situations de networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier de potentielles opportunités business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La contribution active au développement d’Artefact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer une offre, une Industrie, un chapter ou un partenariat avec votre école&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer au processus de recrutement par le biais d&#39;entretiens avec les candidats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Animation de différents trainings pour former les nouveaux arrivants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact Interne&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soutenir le référent référent sur une ou plusieurs expertises et les développer (Stratégie, data governance, data marketing... ) : construction de nouvelles offres, formation des consultants, actions marketing, développement de partenariats, pitchs clients....&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la diffusion des connaissances du département Conseil au sein de l&#39;entreprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à des événements externes et créer du contenu Artefact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Devenir une partie intégrante du processus de recrutement, nous aider à recruter les prochains talents, et ensuite coacher et développer les compétences des consultants juniors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez 2 à 3 ans d&#39;expérience professionnelle dans un cabinet de conseil,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un profil avec une double casquette ‘business’ et ‘data’ :&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes curieux(se) et passionné(e) par les sujets liés à la data et à l’évolution technologique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un état d&#39;esprit analytique et aimez la résolution de problèmes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez de l&#39;expérience dans la gestion des clients, vous savez comment identifier les opportunités commerciales et vous aimez les interactions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous faites preuve de rigueur et proactivité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez : Suite Google/Pack Office, outils de workshop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une excellente communication (écrite / orale) en &lt;strong&gt;Français&lt;/strong&gt; et en &lt;strong&gt;Anglais&lt;/strong&gt; est obligatoire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une localisation idéale: nous somme basé en plein cœur de Paris dans le 9ème arrondissement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un mélange unique de talents (Data consultants, Data Analyst, Data scientist, software engineer), et une hyper croissance continue offrant de nombreuses opportunités de carrières rapides.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un endroit idéal pour apprendre : Vous maîtriserez les compétences clés du monde de l&#39;entreprise de demain : vous recevez des formations régulières sur la technologie (offre Artefact, technologies de la donnée,...), votre travail en équipes hybrides, vous apprenez les façons de travailler spécifiques à la tech (product mindset, agilité...). A la fin de votre expérience Artefact, vous êtes un leader technologique expérimenté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La culture : Innovation, Collaboration et Action sont nos valeurs, pour faire simple, nous sommes des faiseurs qui travaillent ensemble afin de créer des solutions innovantes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esprit d&#39;entreprise : vous rejoindrez une équipe d&#39;entrepreneurs motivés. Nous n&#39;abandonnerons pas tant que nous n&#39;aurons pas fait un grand pas dans ce secteur !&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Hybrid working pattern&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a new generation of a data service provider, specialising in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organisations. We are proud to say we’re enjoying skyrocketing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our broad range of data-driven solutions in data consulting and digital marketing are designed to meet our clients’ specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we’ve acquired with our 1000+ client base around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have over 2000 employees across 36 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: State of the art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant, you are a team leader - you will receive the coaching of the most senior people at Artefact and you will be in constant contact with our clients to drive success. You will take the responsibility and ownership of the quality and timeliness of the project delivery while contributing to the vision and organising the next steps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed in this role, the Senior Consultant needs to be a true problem-solver and project manager, relying on the expertise of others (data scientists, data engineers, or their peers and clients) and getting a very detailed understanding of what great looks like for their clients. They will be able to adapt to a vast diversity of missions while acquiring a fine knowledge of the complex organisations to make data go beyond technology and drive real business impact. Leveraging the right and smart data to improve the business outcome for our clients is the DNA of a Senior Consultant at Artefact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant, your missions will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding clients needs and build your convictions to create success in your missions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulating strategies, roadmaps, action plans and communicate them efficiently in writing and orally to the clients and other team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organising the delivery of projects end-to-end, from briefing and managing your teams to driving clients in the right direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspiring and contribute to deliverables with a desire to lead by example, while your philosophy is to create legitimacy on the ground&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving the commercial roadmaps with your managers and partners and helping to build knowledge for Artefact as you build industry / topic expertise project after project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individuals who align with our values; We value potential over existing knowledge. We value ideas over hierarchy. We value actual work over nice talks. We value people over experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We love individuals who are curious and problem-solving.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a strong appetite for those who want to discover new things even when it pushes them out of their comfort zone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We would appreciate people who are as passionate as us in all things digital, data and tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to demonstrate autonomy, high-quality deliverables, strong attention to detail and the ability to build long-term customer relationships is a must, you will also have a strong appetite to grow in the world of Data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artefact is the place to be: &lt;/strong&gt;come and build the future of marketing,&amp;nbsp; join a community, we have a team of experts and professionals worldwide that will always be willing to help&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get immersed into the digital and data industry:&lt;/strong&gt; meet the most innovative partners, deliver cutting-edge projects, and see the industry from backstage. Sooner than you think, you’ll talk about Machine Learning, DevOps and AI like a pro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Progress:&lt;/strong&gt; Every day offers new challenges and new opportunities to learn. At Artefact, we take training very seriously, and you’ll be coached and mentored on your technical, consulting, and interpersonal skills on a regular basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; join an diverse, collaborative, and action-oriented team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurship: &lt;/strong&gt;you will be joining a team of driven entrepreneurs, come and help industry leaders transform through data, we won’t give up until we make a huge dent in this industry!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do you think like a management consultant, thrive in a high-growth environment, and can&#39;t stop thinking about the intersection of data, technology, and business strategy? Are you the person clients turn to when the problem is complex, the stakes are high, and the path forward isn&#39;t obvious yet?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;With over 2,000 employees, 36 offices on five continents, and world-class clients like Samsung, L&#39;Oréal, and Mattel, Artefact is a consulting firm that transforms data into measurable value and business impact. We&#39;ve recently launched in the US with offices in NYC and Los Angeles — and we want you to join us as a cornerstone of our founding team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Founded and headquartered in Paris, Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm specializing in data, analytics, and AI consulting — dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organizations. We don&#39;t just advise; we build, implement, and deliver results our clients can measure.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We have 2,000 employees across 36 offices focused on accelerating digital transformation for some of the world&#39;s most recognizable brands. Our state-of-the-art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies, and cohesive teams of elite business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts are all laser-focused on delivering real value to every client. We design data-driven solutions tailored to each client&#39;s specific needs — always conceived with a business-first mindset and delivered with tangible, measurable results. Our expertise is built on deep AI knowledge acquired through 1,000+ client engagements across the globe.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find out more at artefact.com.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As a Senior Consultant, you&#39;ll be a driving force in our US practice — leading high-impact client engagements, shaping analytical strategy, and setting the standard for delivery excellence on our founding team. You won&#39;t just surface insights; you&#39;ll own the client relationship, structure the narrative, and be directly accountable for outcomes that move the needle for major global brands.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a high-visibility role with real scope from day one. You&#39;ll partner with senior client stakeholders, bring clarity to ambiguous problems, and translate sophisticated data work into decisions that executives act on. You&#39;ll also help shape what Artefact looks like in the US — contributing to proposals, developing thought leadership, and actively building our market presence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defining client needs through in-depth discovery — conducting structured interviews with client teams and technology partners to surface the real problem beneath the stated one&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performing advanced data analysis and rigorous research to solve high-impact, strategic challenges that matter to our clients&#39; bottom lines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building, formulating, and presenting data-driven strategic recommendations that are compelling, actionable, and boardroom-ready&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developing new business proposals that win — translating Artefact&#39;s capabilities into clear, persuasive value propositions for prospective clients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contributing to thought leadership and content development on business-relevant topics, including Artefact-published research, articles, and business cases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taking full ownership of project delivery — ensuring workstreams are aligned, on schedule, and meeting client expectations, with support from a Manager or Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentoring and developing junior consultants and interns, actively investing in the talent pipeline that will define our US team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re looking for proven leaders and sharp thinkers who are ready to make their mark — people who bring a point of view, thrive in ambiguity, and hold themselves accountable to outcomes, not just outputs. As a senior member of our founding US team, you&#39;ll help define what excellence looks like at Artefact in North America. We&#39;ll give you the platform and the tools to do your best work — and you&#39;ll arrive ready with the following:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Undergraduate degree with strong academic performance; advanced degree (MBA or MSc in a quantitative field) is a significant asset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3–5 years of full-time experience in one or more of the following: consulting, data/analytics, marketing, advertising, finance, or tech — with a clear track record of client-facing delivery and independent problem-solving&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills; you can represent Artefact with confidence and credibility at the senior client level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead and collaborate across diverse, multicultural teams; strong intercultural communication skills are essential in our global environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced proficiency in Excel and PowerPoint; experience with SQL, Python, or R is a strong differentiator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine passion for data, digital, and the broader tech and AI economy — you follow this space because you love it, not because you have to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A natural teaching orientation and demonstrated ability to mentor junior team members; you make the people around you better&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep knowledge of strategy consulting and/or digital marketing — within a consultancy, start-up, or agency — is highly desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You Should Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this stage in your career, you have options. Here&#39;s what makes Artefact different:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Real ownership, right away. We&#39;re building our US practice from the ground up, which means your contributions don&#39;t disappear into a bureaucracy — they shape the trajectory of an entire market.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work that&#39;s actually at the frontier. Our clients aren&#39;t asking yesterday&#39;s questions. You&#39;ll be tackling problems where AI and advanced analytics are actively reshaping industries — and you&#39;ll be expected to lead that conversation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;A global network that makes you better. With 36 offices worldwide, you&#39;ll tap into methodologies, expertise, and colleagues across every major market. Our scale gives you resources; our culture gives you autonomy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are united by our values and strengthened by our hybrid expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;There is always a way — We&#39;re builders, diggers, and makers. Ideas only count if they get executed.Client trust is won in the field — We show up where it matters, working side by side with our clients to solve what&#39;s real.If not used, it is useless — We build for adoption and impact. True brilliance is measured by what changes, not what&#39;s delivered.If not shared, our work is not done — Sharing knowledge is how we close the loop — for our clients and for each other.We learn every day — In a field moving at the speed of light, intellectual curiosity isn&#39;t optional. It&#39;s survival.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The estimated base compensation for this role is $125,000 – $135,000. Individual compensation is determined by skills, qualifications, and experience. In addition, this role is eligible for a competitive benefits package.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a new generation of data service provider, specialising in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organisations. We are proud to say we’re enjoying skyrocketing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our broad range of data-driven solutions in data consulting and digital marketing are designed to meet our clients’ specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we’ve acquired with our 1000+ client base around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have over 2000 employees across 26 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: State of the art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Data Engineer to join our dynamic team. This role is ideal for someone with a deep understanding of data engineering and a proven track record of leading data projects in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain scalable and robust data pipelines using SQL and Python, and leveraging any of the following: Databricks, Snowflake, Azure Data Factory, AWS Glue, Apache Airflow and Pyspark.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the integration of complex data systems and ensure consistency and accuracy of data across multiple platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement continuous integration and continuous deployment (CI/CD) practices for data pipelines to improve efficiency and quality of data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with data architects, analysts, and other stakeholders to understand business requirements and translate them into technical implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and manage a team of data engineers, providing guidance and mentorship to ensure high-quality project deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and enforce best practices in data governance, security, and compliance within the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise data retrieval and develop dashboards and reports for business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously evaluate new technologies and tools to enhance the capabilities of the data engineering function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of industry experience in data engineering with a strong technical proficiency in SQL, Python, and big data technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in building scalable data workflows using cloud-native orchestration tools and distributed data processing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with Infrastructure as Code tooling such as Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of CI/CD principles and DevOps/DevSecOps practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership skills and experience managing data engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to work with ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in leveraging AI-assisted workflows to optimise task efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of data architecture involving data mesh, data lake, data warehouse and data lakehouse.&lt;/li&gt;
