&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; a passion for working with data to derive actionable insights and solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication skills:&lt;/strong&gt; excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to discuss both technical and non-technical topics with clients and team members.&lt;/li&gt;
