&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Lead the Future of Generative AI and Large Language Models&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you an experienced software systems engineer with a passion for designing and deploying complex, scalable solutions? Artefact is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Systems Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Brussels office. If you thrive in the intersection of cutting-edge technology and impactful AI applications, this is your opportunity to take the lead in building robust systems and contributing to transformative projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An accomplished professional with at least 4 years of experience in software systems engineering, particularly in AI-driven environments and consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in DevOps methodologies and proficient with Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, and cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, Azure, GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong leader with a history of managing projects and teams, delivering tailored solutions that exceed client expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at fostering collaboration in multicultural, multidisciplinary teams and building lasting relationships with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to stay ahead of the curve, continually learning about emerging technologies and integrating them into best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a leading Data &amp;amp; AI consulting firm at the forefront of AI innovation. With a global presence, we collaborate with top-tier clients across industries, including healthcare, manufacturing, and media, to harness the transformative power of generative AI. Our team in Belgium is specialized in LLM and GenAI projects, working on the most advanced applications of these technologies. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead System Design and Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect and implement scalable, reliable software systems that adhere to the highest standards in DevOps, containerization, orchestration, and cloud technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deploy and Optimize Complex Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize Docker, Kubernetes, and Terraform to deploy robust applications and ensure their optimal performance and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project and Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage multidisciplinary teams, guiding them to deliver projects that meet and exceed quality standards, timelines, and client expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with clients to understand their needs and provide innovative, tailored solutions that maximize the potential of AI-powered systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promote Best Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and uphold industry best practices and company standards across all engineering activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Ahead of Technological Trends:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and adopt emerging technologies to maintain Artefact&#39;s position at the forefront of the AI and software engineering landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong foundation in software systems engineering, with significant experience in DevOps, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, and cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of managing complex software deployment projects and leading diverse teams to success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to solve intricate technical challenges and innovate within the software engineering field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and interpersonal skills, enabling effective collaboration with team members and impactful client interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steadfast commitment to delivering excellence and fostering a culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pivotal role in shaping the future of AI-powered systems, contributing to high-impact, groundbreaking projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic, collaborative work environment that values creativity, professional growth, and inclusivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to state-of-the-art tools and dedicated resources for your ongoing development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A beautiful location in Brussels, offering an excellent work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value expertise, leadership, and a drive to innovate. If you&#39;re ready to lead and make a tangible impact in the world of generative AI, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
