&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a new generation of data service provider, specializing in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organizations. We are proud to say we’re enjoying skyrocketing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our broad range of data-driven solutions in data consulting and digital marketing are designed to meet our clients’ specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we’ve acquired with our 1000+ client base around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have over 1500 employees across 20 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: State of the art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB SUMMARY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Tech Lead, you will be responsible for leading a team of developers, ensuring the quality and efficiency of software development projects. You will oversee the technical aspects of software development, provide mentorship, and collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver high-quality solutions. Your role is pivotal in driving the technical vision, ensuring best practices, and fostering a culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical planning, execution, and successful delivery of software projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make architectural decisions and guide the team in the development of scalable, maintainable, and robust solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends to drive innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical mentorship and guidance to developers, fostering professional growth and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct code reviews to ensure adherence to best practices, coding standards, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate team collaboration, ensuring effective communication and coordination among team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with project managers and stakeholders to define project requirements, scope, and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor project progress, identify potential risks, and implement mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely delivery of projects within budget and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain complex software systems and applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues, ensuring system reliability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize and refactor existing codebases to improve efficiency and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaboration and Communication&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers, designers, and other stakeholders to align technical solutions with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical concepts and solutions effectively to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote a collaborative and inclusive team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, Engineering, or a related field. Advanced degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in software development, with at least 2 years in a leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in leading and managing development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in software architecture and design patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in programming languages such as Java, Python, JavaScript, or others relevant to the tech stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with front-end and back-end development frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud) and DevOps practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Agile methodologies and tools (e.g., Jira, Trello).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferable previous experience of working in the Insurance industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Azure, SQL Server, and GraphQL is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and analytical abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and mentoring skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and work under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in microservices architecture and containerization (Docker, Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of database management systems (SQL, NoSQL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines and automated testing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source projects or active participation in the tech community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position may require occasional travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work arrangement: two days per week working from the office near St. Paul’s&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Lead the Future of Generative AI and Agentic systems&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you an experienced AI engineer with a passion for generative AI, agentic systems, and technical leadership? Artefact Belgium is looking for a Tech Lead – Gen AI to own the technical vision of our AI projects, mentor a team of engineers, and drive cutting-edge solutions for our clients. If you have 6-7+ years of experience in AI and consulting, combined with a strong sense of technical ownership and a talent for enabling others, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Paris, Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm specializing in data, analytics, and AI, focused on transforming data into business impact. We help clients grow their data and digital capabilities while growing ourselves. Our team in Belgium specializes in GenAI and agentic AI projects, working on the most advanced applications of these technologies. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leader: &lt;/strong&gt;You naturally set the bar for engineering quality. You make architectural decisions confidently, lead by example, and know when to roll up your sleeves and code alongside your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and enabler: &lt;/strong&gt;You thrive on helping others grow. You enjoy guiding junior and medior engineers, establishing best practices, and building a team culture of technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client-facing expert:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable being the primary technical point of contact for clients — translating complex AI concepts into business value and building trusted relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic innovator: &lt;/strong&gt;You keep a close eye on the state of the art in generative AI and know how to apply emerging techniques to real-world, production-grade challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous and accountable: &lt;/strong&gt;You take ownership of outcomes,&amp;nbsp; from architecture to delivery, and proactively flag risks and opportunities throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the technical vision: &lt;/strong&gt;Define and drive the technical architecture of AI-powered solutions across client engagements, including RAG systems, agentic AI architectures, multi-modal applications, and multi-agent workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead by example:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay hands-on : contribute to critical parts of the codebase, conduct code reviews, and set engineering standards that the team rallies around.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor a small team:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide a team of 2-6 engineers and data scientists, helping them grow technically and professionally. Contribute to team-building efforts, including involvement in hiring and onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish evaluation frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement comprehensive quality metrics and benchmarks to ensure production-ready, reliable AI solutions that meet client requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage and advise clients:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary technical lead in client interactions — translating business needs into AI solutions, presenting technical choices, and building long-term trust throughout project lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the AI roadmap: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify new use cases, optimize performance and contribute to the development of internal AI tools and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee deployment and maintenance of AI systems, including model serving, API development, vector databases, and orchestration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Publish insights, present at conferences, and drive internal knowledge sharing on emerging AI technologies, agent frameworks, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in computer science, engineering, mathematics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 6-7 years of professional experience in AI, with a strong focus on Machine Learning, generative AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a technical lead or senior engineer, with a track record of owning architecture decisions and guiding engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting experience, including managing client relationships and delivering tailored, production-grade solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in modern generative AI techniques including RAG systems, agentic workflows, multi-agent architectures, evaluation frameworks, and production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python and extensive experience with AI frameworks and cloud providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to present technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in English, Dutch, or French is required; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be eligible to work in Belgium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with your expertise and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine technical leadership role with real ownership : architecture decisions, team direction, and client impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-impact opportunities to work with state-of-the-art generative AI technologies and solve real-world challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, inclusive workplace with access to global expertise through Artefact&#39;s international network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to shape the direction of a fast-growing GenAI team within a leading global consulting firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value technical leadership, a drive to innovate, and the ability to bring out the best in others. If you&#39;re ready to own the technical direction of cutting-edge AI projects and make a tangible impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do you think like a management consultant, thrive in a startup environment, and can’t stop thinking about the intersection of data, technology, and AI?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;With over 2000 employees, offices on five continents, and world-class clients like Samsung, L’Oreal, and LVMH,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Artefact&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a consulting firm that transforms data into value and business impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded and headquartered in Paris, Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm, specializing in data, analytics &amp;amp; Ai consulting, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organizations. We are proud to say that we help our clients grow their data and digital capabilities, and that we’re also growing in parallel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have 2000 employees across 34 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Our state-of-the-art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts are all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client. We design data-based solutions to meet our clients&#39; specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we&#39;ve acquired with our 1000+ client base around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.artefact.com/&quot;&gt;artefact.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The VP of Analytics Engineering will be a pivotal leader in shaping and executing our&amp;nbsp;analytics and insights strategy, ensuring our clients receive data-driven insights and&amp;nbsp;validated metrics to make critical decisions. As a key member of the leadership team, you&amp;nbsp;will drive the strategic direction and implementation of executive reporting, insights, and&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge analytics solutions for a diverse portfolio of clients. You will lead efforts in&amp;nbsp;bringing the right data to every stage of client engagement, from initial strategy and ideation&amp;nbsp;to implementation and performance measurement, with a strong focus on establishing robust&amp;nbsp;data quality and structure, and building the technical aptitude of the team. If you are a&amp;nbsp;strategic thinker and leader passionate about leveraging data to drive business impact for&amp;nbsp;clients, we invite you to apply for this challenging and rewarding role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key tasks include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and inspire a high-performing team of data analysts and consultants,&amp;nbsp;fostering a culture of collaboration, continuous learning, and client-centric innovation,&amp;nbsp;with an emphasis on developing strong technical aptitude and expertise in data&amp;nbsp;analysis and modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Inform and help execute the talent acquisition and development strategy of our Analytical Engineers, both onshore and offshore to maintain the highest levels of educational and professional backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the development of executive-facing data analytics products and solutions,&amp;nbsp;providing our clients&#39; C-suite with the data and insights they need to run their&amp;nbsp;businesses effectively, ensuring high data quality and well-structured data&amp;nbsp;foundations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data findings into clear, actionable insights and serve as a key&amp;nbsp;partner to stakeholders in making strategic decisions for our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional client teams, including marketing, sales, and&amp;nbsp;finance, to ensure a consistent and accurate view of complex business dynamics,&amp;nbsp;with a focus on maintaining data integrity and consistency across all sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and scale a self-service analytics model, empowering client business teams with the tools and data literacy needed to make informed decisions&amp;nbsp;independently, supported by the technical proficiency of the analytics team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and select technologies and data tools to support the delivery of&amp;nbsp;high-quality analytics solutions for clients, with a focus on leveraging advanced&amp;nbsp;analytical techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish analytics best practices, ensuring effective data governance, quality, and&amp;nbsp;security standards are maintained across client engagements, emphasizing proactive&amp;nbsp;data quality checks and robust data governance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the analytics roadmap for client projects, defining strategic priorities and&amp;nbsp;aligning resource allocation to maximize business impact, including strategic&amp;nbsp;investments in technical skill development and advanced analytical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and model a culture of excellence, inclusivity, and innovation within the&amp;nbsp;analytics practice, promoting continuous improvement in data analysis and modeling&amp;nbsp;practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;We are seeking a visionary executive and practice leader who is poised to drive massive organizational impact, accelerate our clients&#39; digital and data transformation journeys, and strategically position the firm at the forefront of innovation and disruption in analytics engineering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;As a foundational leader responsible for building our U.S. Analytics Engineering practice from the ground up, we require a VP who is a natural self-starter, decisive, highly collaborative, and possesses an insatiable drive for excellence and continuous learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;You will be empowered with the resources to succeed and will come armed with the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;10+ years of progressive experience in data analytics or a related technical field, including experience in a senior leadership role managing technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Building &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven success in building, leading, and mentoring high-performing, multi-disciplinary teams (Analysts, Analytics Engineers, Consultants), fostering a culture of collaboration, client-centricity, and continuous technical skill development (onshore and offshore).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Demonstrated experience in shaping and executing talent acquisition, professional development, and educational strategies for Analytics and Data Engineering roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Roadmap Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Extensive experience in owning and driving the analytics roadmap for complex client projects, including defining strategic priorities and aligning resource allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Reporting &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven ability to drive the development and delivery of executive-facing data analytics products, translating complex data findings into clear, actionable, strategic insights for C-suite clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exceptional communication skills and experience serving as a key partner to senior client stakeholders across functions (Marketing, Sales, Finance) to drive strategic business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deep expertise in establishing and scaling analytics best practices, with a focus on data governance, data quality standards, security, integrity, and proactive data quality checks across multiple client engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology Evaluation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Significant experience in evaluating, selecting, and implementing technologies and data tools to deliver high-quality analytics solutions, leveraging advanced analytical and modeling techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Service Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Demonstrated success in championing and scaling self-service analytics models, empowering client business teams with the necessary tools, data literacy, and technical support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Track record of building and modeling a culture of excellence, inclusivity, and continuous improvement in data analysis and modeling practices within a professional organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are united by our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;values&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and strengthened by our hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;expertise&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There is always a way:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We&#39;re from the breed of does, of diggers, of makers. Because ideas are valuable only if executed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client trust is won on the field:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Addressing client needs flows better hands on at their side.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If not used, it is useless:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our love for technology translates into a steep desire for adoption, true brilliance is about impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If not shared, our work is not done:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sharing knowledge is the best way to button up a mission, benefitting clients and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We learn everyday:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tech is a land where everything move at the speed of light, you better be ready to challenge yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The estimated base compensation for this role starts at $240,000. Individual compensation is determined by skills, qualifications, and experience. In addition, this role is eligible for competitive benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
